"""Memory Sweep: see what fills your RAM, then end it or remove it.

Usage:
  memory-sweep [--page PAGE]       open the window; PAGE is overview, apps, files,
                                   settings, memory (Memory Optimization) or about
  memory-sweep report [--json]     print a summary
  memory-sweep end KEY [--force]   end every instance of one app (KEY from report --json)
  memory-sweep end-extra KEY [--force]
